#: package/luci-app-uuplugin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/uuplugin/overview.js:118
msgid "A guard rollback disables the service; after investigating, run: /etc/init.d/uuplugin enable && /etc/init.d/uuplugin start"
msgstr "guard 回滚会停用本服务；排查后执行 /etc/init.d/uuplugin enable && /etc/init.d/uuplugin start 恢复"

#: package/luci-app-uuplugin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/uuplugin/config.js:70
msgid "Accelerated Devices"
msgstr "加速设备"

#: package/luci-app-uuplugin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/uuplugin/overview.js:194
msgid "Acceleration tunnels"
msgstr "加速隧道"

#: package/luci-app-uuplugin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/uuplugin/overview.js:143
msgid "All three present (uu zone, lan_uu, uu_lan)"
msgstr "三段齐全（uu zone、lan_uu、uu_lan）"

#: package/luci-app-uuplugin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/uuplugin/overview.js:155
msgid "Armed: a dangerous change is inside its unconfirmed window (or a previous change never finished)"
msgstr "布防中：有危险变更处于未确认窗口（或上次变更未收尾）"

#: package/luci-app-uuplugin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/uuplugin/config.js:35
msgid "Auto-add Nintendo devices"
msgstr "自动加入任天堂设备"

#: package/luci-app-uuplugin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/uuplugin/config.js:31
msgid "Auto-detect consoles"
msgstr "自动识别游戏机"

#: package/luci-app-uuplugin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/uuplugin/config.js:36
msgid "Automatically add devices matching a Nintendo OUI. Warning: an auto-added device automatically leaves PassWall, which changes its traffic path. Enable with care."
msgstr "命中任天堂 OUI 的设备自动加入加速。警示：自动加入 = 该设备自动脱离 PassWall，属于改变流量路径的动作，默认关闭，慎开。"

#: package/luci-app-uuplugin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/uuplugin/overview.js:165
msgid "Bypass ACL not rendered"
msgstr "绕行 ACL 未渲染"

#: package/luci-app-uuplugin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/uuplugin/overview.js:165
msgid "Bypass ACL rendered"
msgstr "绕行 ACL 已渲染"

#: package/luci-app-uuplugin/root/usr/share/luci/menu.d/luci-app-uuplugin.json:24
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: package/luci-app-uuplugin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/uuplugin/config.js:40
msgid "Dead-man switch: after a dangerous change, if it is not confirmed within this many seconds and the network is down, the change is rolled back automatically."
msgstr "死人开关：危险变更后此秒数内未确认且断网则自动回滚。"

#: package/luci-app-uuplugin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/uuplugin/config.js:23
msgid "Device list and switches for the NetEase UU accelerator / PassWall coexistence layer. Dynamic configuration lives in /etc/config/uuplugin; the firewall zone and the PassWall bypass ACL are rendered from it by the uuplugin service."
msgstr "网易 UU 加速器 / PassWall 共存层的设备列表与开关。动态配置的唯一入口是 /etc/config/uuplugin；防火墙 zone 与 PassWall 绕行 ACL 由 uuplugin 服务据此渲染。"

#: package/luci-app-uuplugin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/uuplugin/config.js:71
msgid "Devices accelerated by UU; they bypass PassWall at the same time. After Save & Apply a procd reload re-renders the PassWall bypass ACL: PassWall is restarted and proxy clients lose connectivity for a few seconds."
msgstr "走 UU 加速的设备，这些设备会同时绕过 PassWall。保存并应用后由 procd reload 触发重渲染：PassWall 会被重启，代理客户端瞬断数秒。"

#: package/luci-app-uuplugin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/uuplugin/overview.js:116
msgid "Disabled"
