#: package/luci-app-uuplugin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/uuplugin/config.js:55
msgid "HTTP probe URLs for the egress health check; ICMP and HTTP probes count as healthy if either passes. Leave empty for the built-in defaults."
msgstr "出网自检的 HTTP 探针 URL；ICMP 与 HTTP 任一通过即算正常（防 ICMP 限流误判）。不设则用内置默认。"

