msgid "Upper bound in seconds to wait for the inet passwall table to come back after PassWall is restarted; it is a deadline, not a fixed delay. If a slow device (e.g. MT7621) gets misjudged as a failed restart, raise it to 60."
msgstr "重启 PassWall 后等待 inet passwall 表回来的上限秒数；是上限不是定长等待。慢设备（MT7621 等）被误判为重启失败时抬到 60。"

